<div id="pf10" class="pf w0 h0" data-page-no="10"><div class="pc pc10 w0 h0"><img class="bi x3 y1a3 w3 h27" alt="" src="bg10.png"/><div class="t m0 x3 he y30 ff9 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff2">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">4<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _12"> </span>局域网原理与技术<span class="_ _45"> </span><span class="ff3">4.4<span class="_ _12"> </span>CSMA/CD (</span>带冲突检测的载波监听多路访问<span class="ff3">)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 y7e ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">4.4<span class="_ _24"> </span>CSMA/CD<span class="_ _5"> </span>(<span class="ff1">带冲突检测的载波监听多路访问</span>)</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y1a4 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">4.4.1<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">基本原理</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y1a5 ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">CSMA/CD<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">主要用于有线局域网（<span class="ff3">Ethernet</span>）<span class="_ _2"></span>。其核心思想可概括为：</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y1a6 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">先听后发，边发边听；冲突停止，随机重发。</div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y1a7 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">4.4.2<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">最小帧长计算（重点掌握）</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y1a8 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">为了确保发送端在发送数据的过程中能够检测到可能发生的冲突，必须满足以下条件：</div><div class="t m0 x76 h7 y1a9 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">发送时延<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffa">≥<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>往返传播时延<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(RTT)<span class="_ _46"> </span>(4.1)</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y1aa ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">设：</div><div class="t m0 x1e h18 y1ab ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝐿</div><div class="t m0 x12 h17 y1ac ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑚𝑖<span class="_ _f"></span>𝑛</div><div class="t m0 x25 h7 y1ab ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">为最小帧长（<span class="ff3">bit</span>）</div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y1ad ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑅<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff4">为数据传输速率（<span class="ff3">bps,<span class="_ _0"> </span>bandwith</span>）</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y1ae ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝜏<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff4">为单程传播时延（<span class="ff3">s</span>）</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y1af ffb fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">2<span class="ff8">𝜏<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff4">为往返传播时延（又称争用期）</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y1b0 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">则计算公式推导如下：</div><div class="t m0 x77 h18 y1b1 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝐿</div><div class="t m0 x78 h17 y1b2 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑚𝑖<span class="_ _f"></span>𝑛</div><div class="t m0 x78 h18 y1b3 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑅</div><div class="t m0 x4c h1a y1b4 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">≥<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffb">2<span class="ff8">𝜏</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x2f h18 y1b5 ff8 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝐿</div><div class="t m0 xc h17 y1b6 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑚𝑖<span class="_ _f"></span>𝑛</div><div class="t m0 x4c h1a y1b5 ffa fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">≥<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffb">2<span class="ff8">𝜏<span class="_ _0"> </span></span></span>×<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑅</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h6 y1b7 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">结论<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _1"></span>若帧长小于该<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff8">𝐿</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x79 h17 y1b8 ffc fs6 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">𝑚𝑖<span class="_ _f"></span>𝑛</div><div class="t m0 x7a h7 y1b7 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">，<span class="_ _1"></span>发送端可能在冲突信号传回之前就发完了数据，<span class="_ _1"></span>从而误认为发送成功。<span class="_ _27"></span>因此，<span class="_ _27"></span>以</div><div class="t m0 x3 h7 y1b9 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">太网规定最短有效帧长为<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">64<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>字节（<span class="ff3">512<span class="_ _0"> </span>bit</span>）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 y1ba ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">4.5<span class="_ _24"> </span>CSMA/C<span class="_ _3"></span>A<span class="_ _5"> </span>(<span class="ff1">带冲突避免的载波监听多路访问</span>)</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h6 y1bb ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">CSMA/CA<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">主要用于<span class="ff1">无线局域网</span>（<span class="ff3">W<span class="_ _29"></span>ireless LAN,<span class="_ _0"> </span>802.11<span class="ff4">）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y1bc ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">背景<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _3"></span>在无线环境中，<span class="_ _3"></span>无法像有线环境那样在发送时进行可靠的碰撞检测（受限于<span class="_ _29"></span>“隐蔽站”问题和信号</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h7 y1bd ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">衰减）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y1be ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">机制<span class="ff4">：通过预约信道（<span class="ff3">R<span class="_ _3"></span>TS/CTS<span class="ff4">）<span class="_ _2"></span>、帧间间隔（<span class="ff3">IFS</span>）和确认机制（<span class="ff3">A<span class="_ _29"></span>CK<span class="ff4">）来尽量<span class="ff1">避免</span>冲突的发生。</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 y1bf ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">4.6<span class="_ _24"> </span>CSMA/CD<span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff1">与<span class="_ _5"> </span></span>CSMA/C<span class="_ _3"></span>A<span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff1">的区别</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7b h6 y1c0 ff1 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">表<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">4.1:<span class="_ _9"> </span><span class="ff4 fc0">两种协议的对比</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7c h6 y1c1 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">比较维度<span class="_ _3d"> </span><span class="ff6">CSMA/CD<span class="_ _47"> </span>CSMA/CA</span></div><div class="t m0 x7c h6 y1c2 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">应用场景<span class="_ _3d"> </span><span class="ff4">有线局域网<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(Ethernet)<span class="_ _3a"> </span></span>无线局域网<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(WLAN)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7c h6 y1c3 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">处理冲突方式<span class="_ _3f"> </span><span class="ff4">检测冲突<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(Detection)<span class="_ _48"> </span></span>避免冲突<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(A<span class="_ _4"></span>voidance)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7c h6 y1c4 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">发送策略<span class="_ _3d"> </span><span class="ff4">边发边听，冲突即停<span class="_ _49"> </span>发送前侦听，发送后等待<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">A<span class="_ _29"></span>CK</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x7c h6 y1c5 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">能否同时发送与接收<span class="_ _3a"> </span><span class="ff4">可以<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(</span>全双工<span class="ff3">/</span>半双工<span class="ff3">)<span class="_ _17"> </span></span>很难<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(</span>无线设备通常不能<span class="ff3">)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x3 he y5f ff9 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc7"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">11<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>页<span class="_ _0"> </span></span><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc9"></span></span></div></div><div class="pi" data-data='{"ctm":[1.000000,0.000000,0.000000,1.000000,0.000000,0.000000]}'></div></div>
